  ('GEO 214', 'Climatic Systems and Regional Climates', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Social Sciences', 'Economics', '200 Level', 'second', 2, 'The thunderstorm. Extra-tropical and tropical synoptic disturbances. Coastal, topographical and urban effects on climate. Climatic classification: the work of Koppen, Miller and others. The climate of West Africa. Theories of climatic change. Adverse and inadvertent modifications of climate. Introduction to applied climatology. Measurement of climatic elements.', '["The thunderstorm. Extra-tropical and tropical synoptic disturbances", "Coastal, topographical and urban effects on climate", "Climatic classification: the work of Koppen, Miller and others", "The climate of West Africa", "Theories of climatic change. Adverse and inadvertent modifications of climate", "Introduction to applied climatology. Measurement of climatic elements"]'::jsonb, 'Department of Geography handbook'),
